# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), AF2_QUEST_LEVEL compared as the Lua compares it (a number, no rounding): a level 50
# beastmaster with the setting at 50.4: 50 >= 50.4 is false, no section (Path of the Beastmaster's 20, then his script);
# at 50: the offer, 141. Wings of Gold then not completed (a GM's delQuest): no section (Wings of Gold's own
# offer 139, then 137).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster completed
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
setting AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 50.4
login
trigger Brutus                  # 50 < 50.4: no section; Path of the Beastmaster's 20
finish-if-event
trigger Brutus                  # the next turn
finish-if-event
setting AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 50
trigger Brutus                  # 50 >= 50: 141
finish option=0                 # Prog 1
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold available
trigger Brutus                  # Wings of Gold not completed: no section; Wings of Gold's 139
finish-if-event
trigger Brutus                  # the next turn
finish-if-event
